{"clase": "<h4>Soluciones múltiples y degeneración</h4>\n<ul><li>En la tabla óptima, si una celda <b>no básica</b> tiene costo reducido <b>0</b>, hay soluciones múltiples. Para mostrar otra, haz entrar esa celda con su circuito: Z no cambia.</li>\n<li>Si una básica vale 0 (degenerada), igual cuenta como básica y se usa en u-v y en los circuitos. Si θ = 0, la iteración cambia la base pero no la solución.</li>\n<li>Exigencias típicas: \"el cliente B exige toda su demanda\" ⇒ M desde el ficticio a B. \"Multa de $4 por unidad no satisfecha\" ⇒ costo 4 desde el ficticio.</li></ul>", "ejemplos": [{"q": "<p>Un fabricante debe enviar todas las unidades que quedan en sus bodegas B1 (4 unid.) y B2 (8 unid.) a los clientes A, B y C, que demandan 7, 4 y 3. Costos unitarios:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>2</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>3</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>El cliente B exige obligatoriamente toda su demanda. A y C cobran $4 y $3 por cada unidad que no se les entregue. (C2 2026-1, Problema 3.)</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> SBF inicial por Esquina Nor-Oeste.</li><li><b>b)</b> Solución óptima con el algoritmo de transporte.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Tiene soluciones múltiples? Si es así, muestre otra.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 12, demanda total = 14. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 2.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td>3</td><td>5</td><td>2</td><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td>4</td><td>5</td><td>3</td><td>8</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>4</td><td>M</td><td>3</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>7</td><td>4</td><td>3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">4</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">8</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"sd\">4</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 3·4 + 4·3 + 5·4 + 3·1 + 3·2 = <b>53</b>. Celdas básicas: 5 = m + n − 1 = 3+3−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 3·4 + 4·3 + 5·4 + 3·1 + 3·2 = <b>53</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">4</td><td class=\"uv\">−1</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">8</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span><span class=\"rd\">M−5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">2</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"sd\">4</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">4</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> B1 → A: 4; B2 → A: 3; B2 → B: 4; B2 → C: 1; Fic → C: 2. Z* = <b>53</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (B1,C) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 1) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>B1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">2</span><span class=\"al\">1</span></td><td class=\"sd\">4</td></tr><tr><th>B2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">8</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">4</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">M</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">7</td><td class=\"sd\">4</td><td class=\"sd\">3</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 3·3 + 2·1 + 4·4 + 5·4 + 3·2 = <b>53</b>.</p></div>", "intro": "Problema real del último C2. El ficticio cobra la multa (4 y 3) y tiene M hacia B porque B exige todo."}], "ejercicios": [{"q": "<p>Un laboratorio tiene 3 centros de distribución con capacidades 200, 150 y 225 cajas/semana. Las tiendas A, B, C y D piden 140, 130, 165 y 100 cajas. Costos por caja:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td>15</td><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>10</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td>9</td><td>11</td><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td>12</td><td>14</td><td>3</td><td>14</td><td>225</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>140</td><td>130</td><td>165</td><td>100</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">Guía de transporte resuelta, Problema 3.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> SBF por Esquina Nor-Oeste.</li><li><b>b)</b> Solución óptima.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Es única? Justifique.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 575, demanda total = 535. Sobra oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>destino ficticio</b> con demanda 40.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td>15</td><td>10</td><td>8</td><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>200</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td>9</td><td>11</td><td>7</td><td>5</td><td>0</td><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td>12</td><td>14</td><td>3</td><td>14</td><td>0</td><td>225</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>140</td><td>130</td><td>165</td><td>100</td><td>40</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Esquina Nor-Oeste:</b> se parte en la celda (1,1), se asigna lo máximo y se avanza a la derecha o hacia abajo según se agote la demanda o la oferta.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">140</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">85</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 15·140 + 10·60 + 11·70 + 7·80 + 3·85 + 14·100 + 0·40 = <b>5685</b>. Celdas básicas: 7 = m + n − 1 = 3+5−1.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,4) con −13 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,4)+ → (2,3)− → (3,3)+ → (3,4)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 80 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,3). Z actual = 5685.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">140</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">80</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−13</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−4</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">85</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">12</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (3,1) con −13 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (3,1)+ → (3,4)− → (2,4)+ → (2,2)− → (1,2)+ → (1,1)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 20 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (3,4). Z actual = 4645.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">140</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">60</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">−10</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">70</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">80</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">9</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−9</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−13</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">165</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">25</td><td class=\"uv\">20</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 3. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (2,1) con −7 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (2,1)+ → (2,2)− → (1,2)+ → (1,1)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 50 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (2,2). Z actual = 4385.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">120</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">80</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−7</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−4</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">4</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">165</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">13</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">12</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">1</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 4. Se fija u<sub>3</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (1,5) con −3 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (1,5)+ → (1,1)− → (3,1)+ → (3,5)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 40 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (3,5). Z actual = 4035.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">70</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">130</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−3</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">100</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−3</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">165</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">12</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">3</td><td class=\"uv\">8</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 5. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (1,4) con −1 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (1,4)+ → (1,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,4)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 30 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (1,1). Z actual = 3915.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"al\">30</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">130</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−1</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">50</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">100</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−6</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">165</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">−3</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">15</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">6</td><td class=\"uv\">11</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 6. Se fija u<sub>1</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 10·130 + 10·30 + 0·40 + 9·80 + 5·70 + 12·60 + 3·165 = <b>3885</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>A</th><th>B</th><th>C</th><th>D</th><th>Fic</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>CD1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">15</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">130</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">10</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">40</span></td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>CD2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">80</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"rd\">7</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">5</span><span class=\"al\">70</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"uv\">−5</td></tr><tr><th>CD3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">60</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">3</span><span class=\"al\">165</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">6</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">2</span></td><td class=\"sd\">225</td><td class=\"uv\">−2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">140</td><td class=\"sd\">130</td><td class=\"sd\">165</td><td class=\"sd\">100</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">14</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">5</td><td class=\"uv\">10</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> CD1 → B: 130; CD1 → D: 30; CD1 → Fic: 40; CD2 → A: 80; CD2 → D: 70; CD3 → A: 60; CD3 → C: 165. Z* = <b>3885</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> No: todos los costos reducidos de las celdas no básicas son estrictamente positivos ⇒ la solución es única.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Las plantas A y B producirán 230 y 270 unidades. Fabricar cuesta $3 en A y $2 en B. Los clientes 1, 2 y 3 demandan 150, 200 y 200. Transporte:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>C1</th><th>C2</th><th>C3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>8</td><td>9</td><td>5</td><td>230</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>6</td><td>7</td><td>6</td><td>270</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>150</td><td>200</td><td>200</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"src\">C2 2025-1, Problema 2 a). Ojo: el costo de cada celda es fabricación + transporte.</p><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> Construya la tabla (sumando el costo de fabricación).</li><li><b>b)</b> Determine la solución óptima e indique si existen soluciones múltiples.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 500, demanda total = 550. Falta oferta ⇒ se agrega un <b>origen ficticio</b> con oferta 50.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>C1</th><th>C2</th><th>C3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td>11</td><td>12</td><td>8</td><td>230</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td>8</td><td>9</td><td>8</td><td>270</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>0</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>150</td><td>200</td><td>200</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 9 (columna 2); se asigna 50 a la celda (3,2) de costo 0.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 3 (fila 1); se asigna 200 a la celda (1,3) de costo 8.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 3 (columna 1); se asigna 150 a la celda (2,1) de costo 8.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>C1</th><th>C2</th><th>C3</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">200</span></td><td class=\"sd\">230</td><td class=\"pen\">3/3/1</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">120</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td class=\"sd\">270</td><td class=\"pen\">0/0/1</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"pen\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">8/3/3</td><td class=\"pen\">9/3/3</td><td class=\"pen\">8/0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 12·30 + 8·200 + 8·150 + 9·120 + 0·50 = <b>4240</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija v<sub>2</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 12·30 + 8·200 + 8·150 + 9·120 + 0·50 = <b>4240</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>C1</th><th>C2</th><th>C3</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">200</span></td><td class=\"sd\">230</td><td class=\"uv\">12</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">120</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td class=\"sd\">270</td><td class=\"uv\">9</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">1</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"rd\">4</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">−1</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td class=\"uv\">−4</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> A → C2: 30; A → C3: 200; B → C1: 150; B → C2: 120; Fic → C2: 50. Z* = <b>4240</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (A,C1) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 30) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>C1</th><th>C2</th><th>C3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>A</th><td><span class=\"cc\">11</span><span class=\"al\">30</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">12</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">200</span></td><td class=\"sd\">230</td></tr><tr><th>B</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">120</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">9</span><span class=\"al\">150</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td class=\"sd\">270</td></tr><tr><th>Fic</th><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span><span class=\"al\">50</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">0</span></td><td class=\"sd\">50</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">150</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td class=\"sd\">200</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 11·30 + 8·200 + 8·120 + 9·150 + 0·50 = <b>4240</b>.</p></div>"}, {"q": "<p>Considere el siguiente problema de transporte (costos unitarios):</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>14</td><td>20</td><td>20</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>18</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>16</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>35</td><td>15</td><td>40</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><ol class=\"parts\"><li><b>a)</b> SBF por Vogel.</li><li><b>b)</b> Solución óptima.</li><li><b>c)</b> ¿Hay soluciones múltiples? Si es así, entregue otra solución óptima.</li></ol>", "s": "<div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Tabla de transporte</h5><p>Oferta total = 90, demanda total = 90. El problema está balanceado.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"t\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td>14</td><td>20</td><td>20</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td>7</td><td>8</td><td>18</td><td>45</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td>8</td><td>6</td><td>16</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td>35</td><td>15</td><td>40</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"solpart\"><h5>Solución</h5><p><b>Vogel:</b> penalidad = diferencia entre los dos costos menores de cada fila y columna; en la línea con mayor penalidad se asigna a la celda más barata.</p><ol class=\"log\"><li>Mayor penalidad = 6 (fila 1); se asigna 15 a la celda (1,1) de costo 14.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 2 (fila 3); se asigna 15 a la celda (3,2) de costo 6.</li><li>Mayor penalidad = 11 (fila 2); se asigna 20 a la celda (2,1) de costo 7.</li><li>Queda una sola fila o columna: se completa con el método del costo menor.</li></ol><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"pen\">6</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"pen\">1/1/11</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">16</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2/8</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th class=\"pen\">Penal.</th><td class=\"pen\">1/1/1</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2</td><td class=\"pen\">2/2/2</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 14·15 + 7·20 + 18·25 + 6·15 + 16·15 = <b>1130</b>.</p><p><b>Algoritmo de transporte (u<sub>i</sub>, v<sub>j</sub>):</b></p><p class=\"it\">Iteración 1. Se fija u<sub>2</sub> = 0. Costo reducido más negativo: celda (1,3) con −5 ⇒ <b>entra</b>. Circuito: (1,3)+ → (1,1)− → (2,1)+ → (2,3)−. Menor valor en celdas \"−\": 15 ⇒ <b>sale</b> la celda (1,1). Z actual = 1130.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"al\">15</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td class=\"ent\"><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd neg\">−5</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"uv\">7</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">20</span><span class=\"sg\">+</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">25</span><span class=\"sg\">−</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">16</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">−2</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">7</td><td class=\"uv\">8</td><td class=\"uv\">18</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"it\">Iteración 2. Se fija v<sub>3</sub> = 0 (la fila/columna con más celdas básicas) y se resuelve u<sub>i</sub> + v<sub>j</sub> = c<sub>ij</sub> en las básicas. Costos reducidos c<sub>ij</sub> − u<sub>i</sub> − v<sub>j</sub> de las no básicas: todos ≥ 0 ⇒ <b>solución óptima</b>. Z = 20·15 + 7·35 + 18·10 + 6·15 + 16·15 = <b>1055</b></p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th><th>u<sub>i</sub></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span><span class=\"rd\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"rd\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"uv\">20</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">35</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">0</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td><td class=\"uv\">18</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"rd\">3</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">16</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td><td class=\"uv\">16</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>v<sub>j</sub></th><td class=\"uv\">−11</td><td class=\"uv\">−10</td><td class=\"uv\">0</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>Solución óptima:</b> O1 → D3: 15; O2 → D1: 35; O2 → D3: 10; O3 → D2: 15; O3 → D3: 15. Z* = <b>1055</b>.</p><p><b>¿Soluciones múltiples?</b> Sí: la celda no básica (O2,D2) tiene costo reducido 0. Si entra (θ = 10) se obtiene otra solución con el mismo Z:</p><div class=\"tw\"><table class=\"tt\"><thead><tr><th></th><th>D1</th><th>D2</th><th>D3</th><th>Oferta</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>O1</th><td><span class=\"cc\">14</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">20</span><span class=\"al\">15</span></td><td class=\"sd\">15</td></tr><tr><th>O2</th><td><span class=\"cc\">7</span><span class=\"al\">35</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span><span class=\"al\">10</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">18</span></td><td class=\"sd\">45</td></tr><tr><th>O3</th><td><span class=\"cc\">8</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">6</span><span class=\"al\">5</span></td><td><span class=\"cc\">16</span><span class=\"al\">25</span></td><td class=\"sd\">30</td></tr><tr><th>Demanda</th><td class=\"sd\">35</td><td class=\"sd\">15</td><td class=\"sd\">40</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Z = 20·15 + 7·35 + 8·10 + 6·5 + 16·25 = <b>1055</b>.</p></div>"}]}